-- The decision Decree 67 Article 7(2)(đ) asks for. The decree's "normal value in the guidance
-- of the Ministry of Health" is read as the endogenous alcohol Article 87(5) has the Ministry
-- determine (fork F8): the Law permits no other alcohol (Article 9(2)), so nothing else can be
-- "normal". On that reading the decree's limb and Article 9(2) give the same answer.
@ref Law 36/2024/QH15 Article 9(2), 87(5); Decree 67/2023 Article 7(2)(đ)
GIVEN t IS A `A test of the driver`
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the alcohol reading` t `exceeds the level Decree 67 Article 7(2)(dd) names, on` d MEANS
    `Article 9(2) — the test` t `shows driving with alcohol in the blood or breath, on` d
